fe0090da5770311e43f5fd98146c747998df10d9fab3e65907a8","logical_entry_identity":"330a492f83ffa4b12e2635db7587982b80cd4e992d462fceef2fdaa74f6802e6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"psychic","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"灵能力者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e0d92194ad186646425aaa40e59853c68749610d7b98220c62007171309da25","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78b06c962905bfe678dade06deb1f0e491f40a1f6c464702f7ddb94eba40cf11","logical_entry_identity":"48efe7b30d4f49d10e9860c0be96175f5b1aad14cef439e904533d68c65749d0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I require ingredients for three potent mixtures. Obviously, since I seek your aid, none of them is to be found by simply strolling to the local herbalist's. No, they will need to be forcibly parted from their owners who will, just as obviously, put up a fight. I've yet to encounter a naga who would be persuaded to hand over his tongue! Ha! Oh, I am droll at times.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我需要用于配制三种强效药剂的原料。显而易见，既然我向你求助，这些东西就绝非在本地草药铺随便逛逛就能弄到的。不，它们必须从原主身上强行剥离下来，而同样显而易见的是，对方一定会奋起抵抗。我还没遇到过哪只肯被说服乖乖交出舌头的娜迦呢！哈！噢，我有时候还真挺幽默的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"87be350404157a29033fa4f91f486cfd8339d3185970fb9324896ade8145a6b2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78b091e2e347707b6abb9483feb5622268bb460173bbf0dddc69743e3a8a5c42","logical_entry_identity":"6d07a1c2ac8c401450c225b66db5086ad17fee8580f04b193c8c5ea0080ec7b6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Show message/chat log (#{bold}##GOLD#%s#LAST##{normal}#)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"显示消息/聊天日志 (#{bold}##GOLD#%s#LAST##{normal}#)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c4ace655ad1e118feb9d5686d245d0f59aa505805fdb6463918002aa9b15fb3c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78b1c19fd98dae5ca70821781ef35820542e75f39d3c286a99e4f28a71530406","logical_entry_identity":"f40a370d0c49df689675b8cb95ecbc7c168cd85e1687208e83a8e61d48f1b796","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A bulbous humanoid form floats here. Its bald, child-like head is disproportionately large compared to its body, and its skin is pock-marked with nasty red sores.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个臃肿的人形生物漂浮在这里。它的光头像个孩子，与身体相比大得不成比例，皮肤上布满痘坑，长着狰狞的红色脓疮。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cb503575d757e00f6c792ada7cafd877f34cc43a8a73f3733f0497fe4f45ad59","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78b5d4328feb6ed78a7f056258bee75963bac819bcffa710e471380086644f79","logical_entry_identity":"1788b2b91054e4af92afe6e62f54ad885411bfd22dc5cf9c6e92daeeb44414ec","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Tannen's Tower","source_tag":"_t","target":"泰恩之塔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e3c6a6634087af208a257efc5f7ae77ab5d3814b92563d4b99f9838201cdea4b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78bd1d3c45cfb9489bd9f8c1b5ed7a083277072a1c783c78ac127a47d28be272","logical_entry_identity":"6a464d3aea1fd10782341c10b1ff5448af83db32bf9e6ed7bc58f68d8eaa1b32","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Horrible visions fill your mind.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Plagued by Visions: Your mental save has a 20%% chance to be reduced by %d%% when tested.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sRemoved from Reality: %+d Physical Resistance, %+d Maximum Physical Resistance\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Willpower\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sHarrow: When a foe attempts to inflict a detrimental effect upon you, your harrowing aura retaliates against a random foe in range 10, dealing %d mind and %d darkness damage.\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sNightmare: Each time you are damaged by a foe there is a chance (currently %d%%) of triggering a radius %d nightmare (summon Terrors and chances to slow, deal %d Mind damage, and deal %d Darkness damage) for 8 turns. The chance grows each time you are struck but fades over time.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的脑海中充斥恐怖景象。\n#CRIMSON# 惩罚：#WHITE# 扰乱幻象：当鉴定时，你的精神豁免有 20%%概率减少 %d%%\n#CRIMSON# 强度 1+：%s 从现实消失：%+d 物理抗性，%+d 物理抗性上限\n#CRIMSON# 强度 2+：%s%+d 幸运，%+d 意志\n#CRIMSON# 强度 3+：%s 折磨：当敌人试图对你造成负面效果时，你的折磨光环会对 10 范围内的一个随机敌人进行报复，造成 %d 精神和 %d 暗影伤害。\n#CRIMSON# 强度 4+：%s 噩梦：每次受到目标攻击有概率 (当前 %d%%) 触发一个范围为 %d 码的噩梦（有减速、召唤梦魇和直接造成%d精神、%d暗影伤害的效果）持续 8 回合。  触发几率  在每次你受到打击时提高，同时随时间下降。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9be0854a72f9e0883364d54840db19a9348c614993d6e5960233a687f4182314","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78bede0fabaa224e615bd888c80fde61c0ff670cc863eca77e3d08df37155311","logical_entry_identity":"ca881afc9cfc8648dd0dc085546d1b112508bbe104d088d003e22d39834104b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A formation of blue crystal. Its light shines like the ocean's waves.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个由蓝色水晶构成的生物，它通体荡漾着海蓝色的光芒。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"caa0cfdd5cc060e0eb776ce1341c4fdcbf09b82e3943ea618e868050758e6dbf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78c44b03aa4f4d9086dc95d47e54908529d024bad01dac009621a6ba6f3ef05e","logical_entry_identity":"a108df7559b7003dde7f2bf149769db35ea1e5125a91a89b3f88bb4815d85534","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of rage","source_tag":"entity name","target":"愤怒之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2db7e0e071fa93dcc68e354addc572b197e25bb7d880fd4479cfa41ef7d3066a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78c48b37ddf40e4314f24ad47260d50ab191111013f6f59f55e5effc3292b008","logical_entry_identity":"7a591247b7c29b0c6025289e9f566077c5fadf4295f0818bc952441043d84c75","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This item allows the wearer to attack unseen targets without any penalties.","source_tag":"_t","target":"该物品允许你在攻击不可见单位时不受任何惩罚。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"633d58d82854371c2123a794b513a0e186a9f73ec1358f49155bfc20944a02d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78c5101ed8732870023c76186c6c04e639613de85fc6d35ab7dd0b0aa000410c","logical_entry_identity":"75f34e4e537daca4a6ef3490338f1e2fac0a0cb41f5d2f9d09c5662b8103f066","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"draining blight","source_tag":"damage type","target":"枯萎吸收/生命吸取"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cba6366664e9e09a76869652a1cdc0348d7bb5eb89649333ca56d221